('252.会议室',1,1000,128,'给定一个会议时间安排的数组 intervals，判断一个人能否参加所有的会议，即所有会议时间互不重叠。','输入:intervals = [[0,30],[5,10],[15,20]] 输出:false','class Solution {public boolean canAttendMeetings(int[][] intervals) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();System.out.println(s.canAttendMeetings(new int[][]{{0,30},{5,10},{15,20}}));}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
