('286.墙与门',2,1000,128,'给定一个 m x n 的二维网格，-1 表示墙，0 表示门，INF 表示空房间。填充每个空房间到最近门的距离。','输入:rooms = [[2147483647,-1,0,2147483647],[2147483647,2147483647,2147483647,-1],[2147483647,-1,2147483647,-1],[0,-1,2147483647,2147483647]] 输出填充距离','class Solution {public void wallsAndGates(int[][] rooms) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
