('433.最小基因变化',2,1000,128,'基因序列由 8 个字符组成，每次只能改变一个字符，给定起始和终止基因序列及合法基因库，返回最少变化次数。','输入:startGene = "AACCGGTT", endGene = "AACCGGTA", bank = ["AACCGGTA"] 输出:1','class Solution {public int minMutation(String startGene, String endGene, String[] bank) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();System.out.println(s.minMutation("AACCGGTT","AACCGGTA",new String[]{"AACCGGTA"}));}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
