('696.计数二进制子串',1,1000,128,'给定一个字符串 s，统计并返回具有相同数量 0 和 1 的非空连续子字符串的数量。','输入:s = "00110011" 输出:6','class Solution {public int countBinarySubstrings(String s) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();System.out.println(s.countBinarySubstrings("00110011"));}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
('697.数组的度',1,1000,128,'数组的度是数组里任一元素出现频数的最大值，返回与 nums 拥有相同度的最短连续子数组的长度。','输入:nums = [1,2,2,3,1] 输出:2','class Solution {public int findShortestSubArray(int[] nums) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();System.out.println(s.findShortestSubArray(new int[]{1,2,2,3,1}));}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
('698.划分为k个相等的子集',2,1000,128,'给定一个整数数组和一个正整数 k，判断能否将该数组分成 k 个非空子集，使每个子集的元素和都相等。','输入:nums = [4,3,2,3,5,2,1], k = 4 输出:true','class Solution {public boolean canPartitionKSubsets(int[] nums, int k) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();System.out.println(s.canPartitionKSubsets(new int[]{4,3,2,3,5,2,1},4));}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
('699.掉落的方块',3,1000,128,'给定一系列方块的位置和边长，方块依次掉落并可能落在其他方块上，返回每个方块落下后的最大高度列表。','输入:positions = [[1,2],[2,3],[6,1]] 输出:[2,5,5]','class Solution {public List<Integer> fallingSquares(int[][] positions) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();System.out.println(s.fallingSquares(new int[][]{{1,2},{2,3},{6,1}}));}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
('700.二叉搜索树中的搜索',1,1000,128,'给定二叉搜索树的根节点和一个值，在二叉搜索树中找到该节点并返回以该节点为根的子树，不存在则返回 null。','输入:root = [4,2,7,1,3], val = 2 输出:[2,1,3]','class TreeNode{int val;TreeNode left;TreeNode right;TreeNode(){}TreeNode(int v){val=v;}}class Solution {public TreeNode searchBST(TreeNode root, int val) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null),
('701.二叉搜索树中的插入操作',2,1000,128,'给定二叉搜索树的根节点和要插入的值，将值插入二叉搜索树并保证插入后仍为二叉搜索树，返回根节点。','输入:root = [4,2,7,1,3], val = 5 输出:[4,2,7,1,3,5]','class TreeNode{int val;TreeNode left;TreeNode right;TreeNode(){}TreeNode(int v){val=v;}}class Solution {public TreeNode insertIntoBST(TreeNode root, int val) {}}','public static void main(String[] args) {Solution s=new Solution();}',1,'2026-09-28 10:00:00',null,null);
